A '''Grave Room''' is a room added in [[Afterbirth+]]'s [[Booster Pack #5]] which only appears in the {{s|Dark Room}}. Grave Rooms are part of [[The Forgotten]]'s [[The Forgotten#Unlocking the Forgotten|unlock quest]].

